   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MINUGUA/PROLEY V</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MINUGUA/PROLEY V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektes &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att ge st&#xF6;d till den guatemalanska kongressen i dess arbete med att ta fram lagf&#xF6;rslag i linje med fredsavtalen fr&#xE5;n 1996. Projektet syftar &#xE4;ven till att &#xF6;ka den tekniska kapaciteten hos kongressledam&#xF6;terna och dess r&#xE5;dgivare f&#xF6;r att underl&#xE4;tta lagstiftningsprocessen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to support legislative reforms in line with the Peace Accords signed in 1996. The project also seeks to foster increased technical capacity of the politicians in the Congress and their advisers, which would facilitate the legislative process.</narrative>
  </description>
